@startuml prediction-service-class-diagram
title Level 3: Code - Class Diagram (prediction-service) - FR-15\nOwner: Mostafa Khamis Abozead
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classFontSize 12
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
  BackgroundColor<<component>> #D5EFE0
  BorderColor<<component>> #2E8B57
}
skinparam interface {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
}
hide empty members

legend right
  |<#D5EFE0>   | Class of a component |
  |<#FFFFFF>   | Interface / domain class |
  | Solid arrow, open head | Uses (required interface / class) |
  | Dotted arrow, hollow head | Implements (provided interface) |
  | Filled diamond | Composition |
  | Plain line | Association |
endlegend

interface IPrediction <<provided>> {
  +getLikelihood(goalId): Likelihood
  +runCheck(studentId): void
  +getWarnings(studentId): List<EarlyWarning>
  +getRecoveryActions(warningId): List<RecoveryAction>
}

class PredictionService <<component>> {
  -analytics: IAnalytics
  -repository: IEarlyWarningRepository
  -likelihoodRule: LikelihoodRule
  -overloadTaskFinder: OverloadTaskFinder
  --
  +getLikelihood(...) / runCheck(...)
  +getWarnings(...) / getRecoveryActions(...)
}

IPrediction <|.. PredictionService
class LikelihoodRule <<component>> {
  +evaluate(workload): Likelihood
}
PredictionService --> LikelihoodRule
class OverloadTaskFinder <<component>> {
  +findCauses(goalId): List<Task>
}
PredictionService --> OverloadTaskFinder

interface IAnalytics <<required - Analytics service>> {
  +getGoalWorkload(goalId): Workload
  +isOverloaded(goalId): boolean
  +getStudentWorkloads(studentId): List<Workload>
}

PredictionService --> IAnalytics
interface IEarlyWarningRepository <<required - Database>> {
  +save(item: EarlyWarning): void
  +findById(id): EarlyWarning
  +findByOwner(ownerId): List<EarlyWarning>
}

PredictionService --> IEarlyWarningRepository
class EarlyWarning {
  -warningId: String
  -goalId: String
  -status: String
  -causes: List<String>
  --
  +close(): void
}
class RecoveryAction {
  -type: String
  -description: String
}
IEarlyWarningRepository --> EarlyWarning
EarlyWarning *-- "1..*" RecoveryAction
note bottom of PredictionService
SOLID applied:
S - PredictionService only coordinates; LikelihoodRule, OverloadTaskFinder each do one job.
O - Likelihood rules can be replaced or extended without changing PredictionService (OCP).
L - PredictionService can replace any other IPrediction implementation.
I - IPrediction has only the operations its clients use.
D - PredictionService depends on interfaces (IAnalytics, IEarlyWarningRepository), not on concrete classes.
end note
@enduml
